- Audio: HDMI / MIC / Speaker / SPDIF / 3.5mm Headphones / AP6356S Bluetooth
- USB:
  USB 2.0 HOST x2
  USB 2.0 OTG x1 (shared with USB 3.0 OTG/HOST)
  USB 3.0 HOST x1
  USB 3.0 OTG/HOST x1
- SATA: 1x SATA 3.0 with Power/4-pin
- PCIe: 1x PCIe 3.0 x2 (x4 connecter)

